<title>UK: Bayern Hypo sets 2.0 bln Lux franc Dec 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Bayern Hypo sets 2.0 bln Lux franc Dec 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Banque Internationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    29.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.0</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   PRAECIPIUM  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
